      {q:"What is a real image?",a:"An image formed by actual convergence of rays."},
      {q:"What is a virtual image?",a:"An image where rays appear to meet."},
      {q:"Why does a pencil look bent in water?",a:"Refraction shifts the apparent position of its submerged part."}
